			"notes": "Pre-release 10 is here! This will most likely be the final pre-release for version 2.0. With it, comes a new menu screen, along with various other things!\n\nCHANGELOG:\n- Rebalanced the Solar Emblem a bit\n- Removed an unused audio file\n- Improved enderman spawning\n- Solar emblem renders two when wearing/using two\n- Increased spawnrate of the Cloudcaps biome\n- Fixed Loot Modifier bugs\n- Fixed Veridium creative tab stuff\n- Throwing a Spear of the Blight now damages the item\n- Rebalanced some Loot Modifiers\n- Fixed Tips Mod compat\n- Fixed issue with the Veridium Dart Shooter\n- Updated the design of the Veridium Lantern\n- Added a config to make Cockatrices burn in daylight\n- Enchanted Grass is now the default in the Gilded Groves\n- Added a 1-second delay before the vampire amulet ability goes away\n- Refactored various config options\n- Altered Bagel crafting recipe\n- Added various new pro tips\n- Grand Victory Medal is now dropped by the Valkyrie Queen rather than being in the loot chest, has a 65% chance\n- Veridium tools now make a sound when their infusion expires\n- Fixed Deep Aether Lake grass\n- Fixed Zanberry bush model stuff\n- Renamed Zanberry Shrubs to Zanberry Bush Stems (will be brought back in a future independent resource pack)\n- Added a cooldown to the Adrenaline Rush ability\n- Fixed air under the Slider boss room\n- Fixed Glacia Leaves placement issue\n- Fixed dart shooter models\n- Added a new menu, with 5 different randomizing panoramas (will have a custom menu music in the future, currently uses the GoTV one)\n- Slider music disc is now dropped when a sentry kills another sentry, rather than being crafted\n- Added Crystal Saplings + Crystal Fruit Saplings (obtained by enchanting the former)\n- Fixed crash caused by spark particles\n- Sentry Ring ability now needs you to be holding something to work"
		}
